


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_399b19dd:


    "面朝画布的祥子和在一旁看着的圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a27c8e4f:


    "圣夜子的视线跟随着笔尖，时不时还会提出一些问题，而祥子则一边移动着画笔一边为她解说。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_4a4899cc:


    "——来这边的话，就教你画画哟。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_691b79f5:


    "那是在圣夜子还有翅膀时做的口头约定。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_7f14c70a:



    voice "2SA_0516"
    sachiko "「世界充满色彩以后看起来怎样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_606d6ab3:


    "祥子一边更换着画笔，一边询问着感想。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_2280d599:



    voice "2MI_0632"
    miyako "「我喜欢有颜色的世界。原本只有黑和白的山岭多了许多色彩，变得更加迷人了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_26a78697:



    voice "2SA_0517"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈。那就好……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b7a4c6de:


    "从刚才开始笔头就在调色板上空来回的晃动。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_8acf8835:



    voice "2MI_0633"
    miyako "「不取颜料吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_3094a805:



    voice "2SA_0518"
    sachiko "「还在犹豫选什么颜色啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_35e280b6:



    voice "2MI_0634"
    miyako "「我还以为只要选和景色一样的颜色就好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_62dd6e0a:



    voice "2SA_0519"
    sachiko "「你说的也没错。但将看到的颜色和颜料的颜色联系起来是很困难的。会纠结究竟是不是同一种颜色」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_983e9a89:



    voice "2MI_0635"
    miyako "「绿色不就是绿色吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a6bf4e85:



    voice "2SA_0520"
    sachiko "「你猜光是绿色就有多少种颜色？艳绿、葱绿、翠绿、浅黄、青柠、翡翠、常绿、翠绿……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_ddc6a91f:



    voice "2MI_0636"
    miyako "「又说了两次翠绿」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_6eba821d:



    voice "2SA_0521"
    sachiko "「定下颜色涂上去之后发现完全不是同一种颜色的情况还挺多的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_10fa2638:



    voice "2MI_0637"
    miyako "「说起来，调色板上的红色颜料是用来做什么的？现在不是在画绿色吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_40402365:



    voice "2SA_0522"
    sachiko "「那是因为混着一点红色看起来比全都是绿色更像绿色啊。我也是最近才渐渐体会到的。看，这里……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_9a4ef3f9:


    "祥子指着画布上的一点。圣夜子弯下腰看过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_8c033262:



    voice "2MI_0638"
    miyako "「真的啊，有红色。不告诉我的话我都没注意到」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a4bd0f9a:


    "隐藏在绿色中的些许红色。数个微小的红点让绿色变得更加真实。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_625f48e6:



    voice "2SA_0523"
    sachiko "「我明明只是想把眼前的事物原原本本地画出来而已，实际做起来却这么困难」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b94ad21e:



    voice "2SA_0524"
    sachiko "「眼睛看到的事实在经过意识之后，就会出现多种不同的解释。这就是知识和感觉的差异啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_2c24aa05:



    voice "2SA_0525"
    sachiko "「只能用心观察，自然地挥动画笔，尽可能减小意识的阻碍，让最纯粹的事实流向笔尖」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_9c3555da:



    voice "2MI_0639"
    miyako "「很认真啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a7e4d865:



    voice "2SA_0526"
    sachiko "「当然喽。你之前不知道吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_63a1e3b0:


    "祥子说完，用笔尖从调色板上挑起了一个颜色。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_8f07644f:



    voice "2SA_0527"
    sachiko "「说起来，你为什么穿着制服？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_5a639625:



    voice "2MI_0640"
    miyako "「刚刚从学校回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_be7d09f4:



    voice "2SA_0528"
    sachiko "「明明是周六？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_4eabca11:



    voice "2MI_0641"
    miyako "「被校长叫去的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_73c79191:



    voice "2SA_0529"
    sachiko "「……被校长？没听说啊。于是，出了什么事吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_216ce356:



    voice "2MI_0642"
    miyako "「问我最近过得怎么样。学校啊宿舍生活什么的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_3030c95a:



    voice "2SA_0530"
    sachiko "「……没说什么多余的事情吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_0a7113bc:



    voice "2MI_0643"
    miyako "「多余的事情？啊，关于天使的事情的话什么都——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_06b3b3f3:



    voice "2SA_0531"
    sachiko "「不、不是那个，就是抽烟喝酒什么的——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_9bce87c9:



    voice "2MI_0644"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。这个当然也帮你保密了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_320dbe95:



    voice "2SA_0532"
    sachiko "「真乖」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c1c7b2ed:



    voice "2MI_0645"
    miyako "「但是，校长很关心你哦。说欢迎两个人再一起去找她玩」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c891f610:



    voice "2SA_0533"
    sachiko "「好了好了。有空就去，有空就去」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_ff422f06:



    voice "2MI_0646"
    miyako "「和校长关系很好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_470c39db:



    voice "2SA_0534"
    sachiko "「与其说是关系好不如说是受了她许多照顾。是个爱多管闲事的老奶奶哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_070dcb49:


    "祥子比平时更加用力地在画布上挥动画笔。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_c74e4655:



    voice "2SA_0535"
    sachiko "「好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_66264907:



    voice "2MI_0647"
    miyako "「完成了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_35f926fc:



    voice "2SA_0536"
    sachiko "「嗯。还差一笔、两笔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_97018f30:


    "祥子这么说着，慎重地挑选着用来点睛的画笔。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_b252d9f6:



    voice "2MI_0648"
    miyako "「这幅画也画了很久呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_423733dd:



    voice "2SA_0537"
    sachiko "「毕竟我的手比较笨。虽然这附近有很多常青树所以变化比较小，但即使是这样色彩也渐渐变得不一样了。现在已经是在一边回忆着一边画了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_482737ab:



    voice "2MI_0649"
    miyako "「就用你认为的最适合的颜色不就可以了吗？毕竟这是你的画」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_390d109b:



    voice "2SA_0538"
    sachiko "「……也是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_9087f5f8:


    "画不是照片。祥子和景色之间是隔着一排围栏的，但是画布上的画里却没有。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_a11bc1d3:



    voice "2MI_0650"
    miyako "「第一次见到你的时候，你就在画这幅画」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_c8f844b9:



    voice "2SA_0539"
    sachiko "「是啊，在那之前就开始画了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_21bac494:



    voice "2MI_0651"
    miyako "「在看到画布之前，我还以为你会画更奇怪的画」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_e5f5f899:



    voice "2SA_0540"
    sachiko "「真过分啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_dbe17b12:



    voice "2MI_0652"
    miyako "「因为每天喊着“想画可爱的女孩子的裸体——！”啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_65f864ef:



    voice "2SA_0541"
    sachiko "「那份狂热的话现在也还有哦，要我喊出来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_e3d5eb2b:



    voice "2MI_0653"
    miyako "「不用了。那时候被三个人同时拒绝当模特呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_5b76a582:



    voice "2SA_0542"
    sachiko "「毕竟她们很擅长出场费交涉啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_96fcc5c0:


    "问题不在那里。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_b64adcda:



    voice "2MI_0654"
    miyako "「看着你和那三人一起玩耍的身影，想象了一下自己也在其中的情景」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_3ad680ec:



    voice "2MI_0655"
    miyako "「然后，有一瞬间世界有了颜色。可能从那时起就已经下定决心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_b1758319:



    voice "2SA_0543"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_270ecac8:



    voice "2MI_0656"
    miyako "「想看见那三人看到的，想感受那三人感受到的。这么想着舍弃了翅膀……你曾这么说过」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_b55ced8b:



    voice "2MI_0657"
    miyako "「我也是这么想的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_038f63f4:



    voice "2SA_0544"
    sachiko "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_343c96db:



    voice "2MI_0658"
    miyako "「那么，别的理由是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_2608bf9e:



    voice "2SA_0545"
    sachiko "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_a10f1441:



    voice "2MI_0659"
    miyako "「理由不止这些，你也说过的。说“那又是另一段故事了”」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_d7428c7f:



    voice "2SA_0546"
    sachiko "「我说过吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_e8a85259:



    voice "2MI_0660"
    miyako "「说过」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_95f0c0e8:



    voice "2SA_0547"
    sachiko "「……好了！这是最后一笔了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_de72272b:


    "祥子在画布的背面写上日期和签名。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_93226e42:



    voice "2MI_0661"
    miyako "「画完的画都会写上吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_dab320a4:



    voice "2SA_0548"
    sachiko "「嗯。因为会忘掉啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_a_8a379687:



    voice "2MI_0662"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_2a40c491:



    voice "2MI_0663"
    miyako "「唉，那之后你就再也没见过Noel小姐了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_c365ade1:



    voice "2SA_0549"
    sachiko "「嗯。对方应该也已经忘了我了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_fe3933c5:



    voice "2MI_0664"
    miyako "「我觉得不会的。毕竟都告诉了你要搬去远方了。我也是在远方的小镇见到她的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_6bff53b3:



    voice "2SA_0550"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_b8a7f340:



    voice "2MI_0665"
    miyako "「很难见到她啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_c9a8a6ea:



    voice "2SA_0551"
    sachiko "「见到了又能如何？只是有着同一张脸的陌生人罢了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_c56430fe:



    voice "2MI_0666"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。确实会让Noel小姐大吃一惊吧，突然出现一个和自己一模一样的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_d9570698:


    "这么说着，圣夜子用双手托起脸颊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_c58a0927:



    voice "2SA_0552"
    sachiko "「……我也吃了一惊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_a4364927:



    voice "2MI_0667"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_d46ca01b:


    "圣夜子的表情变得有些认真。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_d784e267:



    voice "2MI_0668"
    miyako "「等到以后，能为我也画一幅画吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_81decbc4:



    voice "2SA_0553"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_5c3113ac:


    "祥子的笔停住了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_48dfb2ee:



    voice "2MI_0669"
    miyako "「我的画，会和Noel小姐的有什么不同吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_d26221ea:



    voice "2SA_0554"
    sachiko "「…………裸体也可以吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_f142de3d:



    voice "2MI_0670"
    miyako "「可以哦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_8a73c6bb:


    "圣夜子立即把手伸向围巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_5539bc6d:



    voice "2SA_0555"
    sachiko "「NO!野外露出NO!不是让你现在脱的意思！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_191613c9:



    voice "2MI_0671"
    miyako "「也是呢，会感冒的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_53420c7d:



    voice "2SA_0556"
    sachiko "「我不是这个意思！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_f7ae7630:



    voice "2MI_0672"
    miyako "「咦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_b9ea6b8b:



    voice "2SA_0557"
    sachiko "「好了好了，今天就到这里。收拾一下下楼了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_36dd1b66:


    "祥子这么说着，取下画布擦了擦画笔。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_88181296:



    voice "2MI_0673"
    miyako "「那么我就收拾颜料吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_d097bbfa:


    "圣夜子把散乱在附近的颜料收集了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_ca112dd5:



    voice "2SA_0558"
    sachiko "「谢谢。注意不要弄脏制服哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_f6ee4101:



    voice "2MI_0674"
    miyako "「是…………♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_7f97b912:


    "圣夜子高兴地把颜料管排列起来。虽然是简单的工作。但也是只有能区分颜色才能做到的事。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_a7be50a7:



    voice "2SA_0559"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_a4a99c06:


    "祥子停下正在洗笔的双手，注视着圣夜子的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_3a1d392b:



    voice "2SA_0560"
    sachiko "「我说……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_b_4b98342a:



    voice "2MI_0675"
    miyako "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_22eb42d3:



    voice "2HI_0771"
    hina "「啊，在这在这」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_564ec0cb:


    "是阳菜。因为寒气一瞬间缩起了脖子，哆嗦着走了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_86a061e5:



    voice "2HI_0772"
    hina "「今天点心有红薯，你们两个吃吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_e0a9eefa:



    voice "2SA_0561"
    sachiko "「哦，正好肚子饿了啊。把这里收拾完就下去～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_77d00659:



    voice "2MI_0676"
    miyako "「红薯……第一次吃啊。真期待♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_9951a8fd:



    voice "2HI_0773"
    hina "「要帮忙吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_e52ff198:



    voice "2SA_0562"
    sachiko "「哦，能帮我把这个画架折起来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_204a0098:



    voice "2HI_0774"
    hina "「好的。你们两个人一边画画一边聊些什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_6015cfe8:



    voice "2MI_0677"
    miyako "「话说……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_42c146a9:



    voice "2SA_0563"
    sachiko "「关于裸体模特的商讨」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_93944c29:



    voice "2HI_0775"
    hina "「吃我一砸啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_c_143e4fa1:



    voice "2SA_0564"
    sachiko "「NO！甩画架NO！」"




translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_e911eeda:


    voice "2MI_0640"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_3b7d1b83:


    miyako "「刚刚从学校回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_9d69af98:


    voice "2MI_0642"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_06_9eb74eba:


    miyako "「问我最近过得怎么样。学校啊宿舍生活什么的」"
